      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，这张募集同好会成员的传单\n不太适合贴这里呢，\n还是移到校舍出入口前的告示板吧──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcfe0af4e3d4afded26ecd4b630252532c9656d36b8719900367c98ecaf6d8a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
