    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7093c13a0d9558ec543a6ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦，气槽。\n你出现得正好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf5c5e92da0a38360ef050c9418a01aefe67fb6e7eab2f56fe1fc966a0fe012d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c143dd6b0ffb2f1296667a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先必须以出道战为目标\n决定今后的训练方针才行。\n于是我立刻动身去找她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b94447664b6d0adeca8dacc240724d67c25974e71a896f2f67530fbbdea4d5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
