    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c74a66674f246c9396c1e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba58fa29016f4366679b31c483127417c7d74c51f8dbea2e0de6e4b65088d5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:120a36c462e38aec14cf96a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下午开定期会议之前，\n我有些事想先跟你确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c678937b97a0ca05b98af646e19e120154ede73bf29227f7b6789e0722f2d86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f0b439e4fee9cf91f23c78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──鲁道夫象征。\n她是特雷森学园的学生会长，\n被誉为实力最强的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b19c8b5d3220a4bf698f5ee2c8c7ec4dfb604f345df4a1a3f072a6c9a83885c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a07fab7f07cd9bed45070b82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她以别人难以追赶的强大实力\n持续拓展着她的皇帝之道，\n是许多赛马娘的憧憬对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23352544b02ef02719a3c4f74f280ec96a9e552fb517f49fd2205201482a495e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b369b2e4fd49dfb0afe3272e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘A",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e9430bf7526a9a3befdb1bbc497b3d1dd69a6e8a0dd7bb7bf98684f4aee0bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
